    "status": "draft",
    "summary": "Adopts the dashboard's authorization boundary as one contract across both sides: the six API routes, the session cookie, the login cooldown and proof-of-work, the SQL guard, and the browser code that is the only client of any of it. Nine findings, five executed, including a single-flight lock that is dropped before it guards anything and an unauthenticated fallback that panics on a multi-byte path. Repairs no runtime behavior.\n",
